{"id":91,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>شَّمْسِ وَضُحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْقَمَرِ إِذَا تَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span><span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">نّ</span>َهَارِ إِذَا جَلَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٤</span>"},{"id":5,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءِ وَمَا بَنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٥</span>"},{"id":6,"tajweed":"وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ وَمَا طَحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"id":7,"tajweed":"وَنَفْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">سٍ و</span>َمَا سَوَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"فَأَلْهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>وَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"},{"id":9,"tajweed":"قَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> أَفْلَحَ مَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن ز</span>َكَّ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>هَا <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٩</span>"},{"id":10,"tajweed":"وَقَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span> خَابَ مَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikha